{"verse":15,"translation":"And the bramble said to the trees, “If in truth you are anointing ⟨את⟩ me as king over you, come, take refuge in my shadow; and if not, let fire go out from the bramble and devour ⟨את⟩ the cedars of Lebanon.”","tokens":[{"surface":"ויאמר","gloss":"And … said"},{"surface":"האטד","gloss":"the bramble"},{"surface":"אל","gloss":"to"},{"surface":"העצים","gloss":"the trees"},{"surface":"אם","gloss":"If"},{"surface":"באמת","gloss":"in truth"},{"surface":"אתם","gloss":"you"},{"surface":"משחים","gloss":"are anointing"},{"surface":"אתי","gloss":"⟨את⟩ me"},{"surface":"למלך","gloss":"as king"},{"surface":"עליכם","gloss":"over you"},{"surface":"באו","gloss":"come"},{"surface":"חסו","gloss":"take refuge"},{"surface":"בצלי","gloss":"in my shadow"},{"surface":"ואם","gloss":"and if"},{"surface":"אין","gloss":"not"},{"surface":"תצא","gloss":"let go out"},{"surface":"אש","gloss":"fire"},{"surface":"מן","gloss":"from"},{"surface":"האטד","gloss":"the bramble"},{"surface":"ותאכל","gloss":"and devour"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩"},{"surface":"ארזי","gloss":"the cedars of"},{"surface":"הלבנון","gloss":"Lebanon"}],"pass":"en5","judge":"glm-5.3"}